{"id":"vod_sn_36555","vodId":"36555","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"噗哔啵～来自未来～","name_cn":"噗哔啵～来自未来～","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/f271a3fd54d774f4070587994aca7ff1.jpg"},"summary":"小学五年级学生姬路若叶（佐佐木诗帆 配音）可人清新，但是周围的同学却对她疏远冷淡。原来她自幼能够看见逡巡在四周的幽灵鬼怪，也常常遭到这些“好朋友”的骚扰，所以不知情的人与她走太近的话就会遭殃。对这一切都漠然处之的若叶，在某天意外见到一个皮球样的奇怪生物，并给它起名小啵（森千早都 配音）。谁知聪颖顽皮的小啵竟有着对付恶灵的神奇能力，这可帮了若叶很大的忙。另一方面，自称不相信灵异现象的大条灵异宅女东礼子（后藤麻衣 配音）转校来到若叶的班级，并阴差阳错和若叶成为了朋友。两个曾经孤独的女孩就此成为朋友，在小啵的陪伴下，她们还将经历许多惊险刺激的灵异体验……　　本片根据押切莲介的原作改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:09","playable":true,"episodeCount":15,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5bv3B5zjbR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wyFb85Ec1r1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tkSrzrnNnU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HmHha7BGJf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uS0RC4Tnkk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Q3gktBvKTe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TSpBxSaX3m1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ifsgCaPeda1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vqsFijCi0s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/40zcvdtdks1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/npdkwN7cHS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cXHhrZCY0G1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fMDsmxBvAi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GMeyaYZ8Y41/video/index.m3u8"}